flowchart LR
 Change[Change / deployment ID] --> Trace[Trace across capabilities]
 Trace --> Latency[Latency and error budget]
 Trace --> Profile[CPU / memory profiles]
 Trace --> Outcome[Product success metric]
 Latency --> Decision[Fix the evidenced bottleneck]
 Profile --> Decision
 Outcome --> Decision
 Decision --> Proof[Regression test and comparison]
